        {
            "parameters": {
                "jsCode": "// Filter out jobs we've already seen (based on link)\nconst newJobs = $('Parse & Deduplicate RSS').all();\nconst existingJobs = $('Read Existing Jobs').all();\n\nconst existingLinks = new Set(\n  existingJobs.map(item => item.json['Job Link'] || item.json.link || '')\n);\n\nconst unseenJobs = newJobs.filter(job => !existingLinks.has(job.json.link));\n\nif (unseenJobs.length === 0) {\n  // Return empty to stop the workflow\n  return [];\n}\n\nreturn unseenJobs;"
            },
            "id": "filter-new-jobs",
            "name": "Filter New Jobs Only",
            "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
            "typeVersion": 2,
            "position": [
                920,
                300
            ]
        },
        {
            "parameters": {
                "modelId": {
                    "__rl": true,
                    "value": "gemini-2.0-flash",
                    "mode": "list"
                },
                "messages": {
                    "values": [
                        {
                            "content": "You are evaluating an Upwork job posting for developer Ayush Rai.\n\nHis skills: Python, FastAPI, LangGraph, LangChain, n8n, Groq, Gemini, Twilio WhatsApp API, Supabase, Next.js, TypeScript, RAG, ChromaDB, vector search, Chrome extensions, JWT auth, PDF generation, Redis, React, Node.js.\n\nHis projects:\n1. TenderPilot AI: RFP auto-filler (React + Node + hybrid vector search + Chrome extension)\n2. D2C Voice Agent: WhatsApp voice AI (FastAPI + LangGraph + Groq Whisper + Twilio)\n3. Invosmith: AI invoice generator (Next.js + Gemini + Groq + GST-compliant PDFs)\n4. SastaBot: WhatsApp price comparison (FastAPI + LangGraph + Redis + Twilio)\n5. ONDC Super Seller: B2B seller dashboard (Next.js + FastAPI + Supabase + WhatsApp)\n6. Private Second Brain: Local RAG (LangChain + ChromaDB + Ollama)\n7. AI Email Pipeline: n8n + Gemini + Gmail auto-classification\n\nRate this job 0-100:\n- skill_match (0-40): how many required skills does he have?\n- project_proof (0-30): can he reference a real built project?\n- rate_fit (0-15): is the budget reasonable? ($20+/hr or fixed $200+)\n- red_flags (0-15): deduct for: free trial requests, 'guru needed', Shopify/WordPress-only, content writing, data entry, unclear scope\n\nReturn ONLY valid JSON (no markdown, no code fences):\n{\"total_score\": number, \"skill_match\": number, \"project_proof\": number, \"rate_fit\": number, \"red_flags\": number, \"matching_projects\": [\"project1\", \"project2\"], \"verdict\": \"APPLY\" | \"MAYBE\" | \"SKIP\", \"reason\": \"one-line explanation\"}"
                        },
                        {
                            "content": "=Job Title: {{ $json.title }}\n\nJob Description:\n{{ $json.description }}\n\nBudget: {{ $json.budget }}"
                        }
                    ]
                },
                "options": {
                    "temperature": 0.3,
                    "maxOutputTokens": 512
                }
            },
            "id": "ai-score-job",
            "name": "AI: Score Job",
            "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatGoogleGemini",
            "typeVersion": 1,
            "position": [
                1140,
                300
            ],
            "credentials": {
